Mars colonisation remains a distant and risky goal.

22
00:01:27.042 --> 00:01:31.134
Your turn. Say: Mars colonisation.

23
00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:35.474
Mars colonisation.

24
00:01:36.483 --> 00:01:37.624
space debris.

25
00:01:38.324 --> 00:01:43.818
space debris means pieces of old satellites and rockets orbiting the Earth.

26
